                          "text":  "Then I simply kept going. In 1983 I passed the orbit of Neptune. My signal grew weaker every year, until the biggest antennas on Earth could barely hear it.\n\nMy last faint signal arrived in January 2003. I was planned for 21 months and I spoke for more than 30 years. I am silent now, coasting toward the stars with a small plaque on my side. It shows who sent me, and where to find you.",
